orm Risk; Winter Storm Central; Responding by Storm; Safety and Preparedness\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"average weather sausalito\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Based on the given passages, here is the answer to the question \\\"What is the average weather like in Sausalito?\\\":\\n\\nAccording to Passage 2, the average weather in Sausalito, California is as follows:\\n\\n* Annual rainfall: 34 inches\\n* Number of days with any measurable precipitation: 56\\n* Average number of sunny days per year: 256\\n* Highest monthly average temperature: 69\u00b0F (in July)\\n* Lowest monthly average temperature: 43\u00b0F (in January)\\n* Comfort index score: 84 out of 100 (based on the total number of days annually within the comfort range of 70-80 degrees, with a penalty for days of excessive humidity)\\n\\nTherefore, the average weather in Sausalito is characterized by mild temperatures, moderate rainfall, and many sunny days throughout the year.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 105, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:8ca136a9b2604299eea55e6be1948534020097d23a225cd8bc85c39b4198213a\"}, {\"end_byte\": 185, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 105, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:eb1e0a474bb88b64ecd7e4512de74a01cfe7051b6cd84c83fd50cc682b68bd45\"}, {\"end_byte\": 262, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 185, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:4a65725e624c13edf07eac3d485c6070fa72f8ff4e60ca38cff320169326058a\"}, {\"end_byte\": 338, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 262, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a24f50ef2d414ec4849f934974316e9f9f43a61b78f75f6f170c89b74ae43c25\"}, {\"end_byte\": 499, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 338, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:306ef5fa611543e7d39bade5c67fe4dc2f9eef97920fdcdc6e86418e487386ed\"}, {\"end_byte\": 521, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 499, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a58c5d22f885260ff2b06d9001500e1375bcd98b680763cf5caaa424d307aba3\"}, {\"end_byte\": 543, \"source_s