Ambience\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":false,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":true,\\\"street\\\":false,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"free\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":4.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Sandwiches, Restaurants, American (New)\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Santa Barbara\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"10:0-19:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"10:0-21:0\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Sam's To Go\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2022-01-03 00:05:08\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"This was our first time at Sams and it was delicious!! Excellent customer service, they were so sweet. We got the #11 Italian cold cuts, and the veggie sandwich #29 both were so good! The bread was so fresh and you could tell the ingredients were really quality! My daughter got the turkey sandwich and she is the pickiest eater and she loved it! Can't wait to go back\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-12-10 03:34:00\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"The couple who runs the place are so nice and funny, and the sandwiches are delicious. It doesn't look fancy, but do yourself a favor and try it out. The Pastrami Avocado and Cheese was delicious. Warning, the medium size sandwich is BIG.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2021-11-28 21:43:45\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":2.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I've been going to Sam's for the past several years while visiting beautiful Santa Barbara from the San Francisco Bay area. I've always enjoyed the sandwiches from Sam's. Unfortunately, my wife and I just finished eating their turkey sandwich and in all honesty, it' was just, Ok, more like disappointing...\\\\n\\\\nWe were disappointed because it appears the quality and taste of the sandwich has digressed to a \\\\\\\"point of no return\\\\\\\"... The sandwich was sloppily made, poorly wrapped, and importantly, the man behind the counter (usual guy) seems to have gotten cantankerous over time. He chastised me for not ordering both white and wheat bread sandwiches the way he wanted, getting perturbed for asking for olives in my sandwich and, he had a smart alec - bad attitude demeanor about him - poor customer service.\\\\n\\\\nSuffice it to say, we will not be going back to Sam's. There are too many good delis in the Cliffs Dr. area to be subjected to poor quality sandwiches and an unpleasant customer experience...\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"\\\"Sam's To Go\\\" is a well-rated sandwich restaurant located at 315 Meigs Rd, Ste I, Santa Barbara, CA.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 862, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c110b0c1fee4f40aad004d2a9077c350c9db9758562c31d6f6a6618d0df645df\"}, {\"end_byte\": 910, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 862, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:1315156f2103aa921ee3172f8d040a91b684c3ef413c7e24f0c00a7ff54858b2\"}, {\"end_byte\": 991, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 910, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:d71b201dba989c715923176c321b3fe650e352d812e670cf1a8451af69b8d7b4\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1070, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 991, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:887342298988dc87ed4b98437d45318a18eb020546e38d0bcf53bfd66b360948\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1154, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 1070, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:265bbaa13b2b10f4ad469c40578775e7b2bb58d59c52575ce21345ebace0fe87\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1336, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 1154, \"text_sha25