0.46.780.292 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "I wouldn't say that everything about Rolling Stone's treatment of that subject was perfect, but it certainly doesn't fall under the same category as their reporting about Jackie's narrative.\"\n", "add_special": true}
