very good value. the food is decent, but they are very stingy with their meat on this plate. its ok if youre really craving mediterranean, but otherwise i wouldnt go there due to the meat portions.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2013-07-11 00:02:00\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I feel really lucky to have found this place. Its in a location that is easily overlooked. I've been searching for good Mediterranean food and I finally found it. The man that works here is so friendly and awesome. The gyro and falafel are great. And I'm pretty sure the pita bread is homemade. Its delicious! I will be back again and again.\\\"}],\\\"state\\\":\\\"CA\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Mediterra Market and Cafe is a Mediterranean restaurant located at 5575 Hollister Ave in Goleta, CA.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 675, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:a69c4cd177b057526d1946b4d3df41cae75765cdc845910e0c3148e87ccc1ea9\"}, {\"end_byte\": 764, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 675, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c321114a1f4051fcd82e0cde454d0ff5fa58d7ae70095c9cc3b8c7c39bb5b9fd\"}, {\"end_byte\": 805, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 764, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:0f303cbba4ba026eedcf88982eb7a81dfb1023882d1c947dd3480cf18023655c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1013, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 805, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:25b9a70c60c6b796c88132fc6a2d7819c2d1d305aa1d7cf6771c105972f50b33\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1089, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 1013, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:aa0b4c303960081177b8f39d4e2dd3cdbba0ec451b7a5806b62094ccf6744dc4\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1313, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 1089, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:69e3f1117f226c4db7da6afb4f095c4e9fa0d14e81ded81d7393a534ec53c141\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1358, \"source_sentence_id\": 6, \"start_byte\": 1313, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:8f60c3e44bae49469c68d762e74576df9905b03089ecab8f85d7070039f5e538\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1430