nce\\\":{\\\"casual\\\":true,\\\"classy\\\":false,\\\"divey\\\":false,\\\"hipster\\\":false,\\\"intimate\\\":false,\\\"romantic\\\":false,\\\"touristy\\\":false,\\\"trendy\\\":false,\\\"upscale\\\":false},\\\"BusinessParking\\\":{\\\"garage\\\":false,\\\"lot\\\":false,\\\"street\\\":true,\\\"valet\\\":false,\\\"validated\\\":false},\\\"Music\\\":null,\\\"OutdoorSeating\\\":true,\\\"RestaurantsGoodForGroups\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsReservations\\\":false,\\\"RestaurantsTakeOut\\\":true,\\\"WiFi\\\":\\\"no\\\"},\\\"business_stars\\\":3.5,\\\"categories\\\":\\\"Food Delivery Services, Chicken Wings, Restaurants, Sandwiches, Food, American (New), Barbeque\\\",\\\"city\\\":\\\"Isla Vista\\\",\\\"hours\\\":{\\\"Friday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Monday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Saturday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Sunday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Thursday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Tuesday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\",\\\"Wednesday\\\":\\\"11:30-21:30\\\"},\\\"name\\\":\\\"Kaptain's Firehouse BBQ\\\",\\\"review_info\\\":[{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2018-11-08 17:11:36\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":1.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"I've never in my life been angry enough to yell at a stranger than I was when I ordered from here one day. And I'm super shy and quiet, so that should say a lot about the customer service. Their food was my favorite until I experienced the worst customer service from a girl who worked their. So I was sad because ofc I wouldn't support them again after that. But oh well.\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-12-03 00:13:26\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":5.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"animal mac- mac n cheese, pulled pork, bbq sauce, and tater tots. the guy hooked it up F A T so blessed this is so good\\\"},{\\\"review_date\\\":\\\"2017-10-15 14:38:40\\\",\\\"review_stars\\\":3.0,\\\"review_text\\\":\\\"Updating my review to inform readers that I have returned here now at least 4 more times and sometimes my food has been less than great. Also, the last 3 times they didn't 