2.04.974.243 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
2.04.974.244 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He'd been drifting on the 35-foot Pearson sailboat for more than two months since leaving Conway, South Carolina, to fish in the ocean. ", "add_special": true}
2.04.974.244 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,4035,978,81344,383,279,220,18,20,19858,56564,28443,36516,364,777,1056,1330,3818,2394,9101,57467,11,4725,12375,11,310,7397,303,279,17415,13,220]}
