2.04.974.708 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
2.04.974.710 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "One of his shoulders was broken, too, so he couldn't fix the boat right away. ", "add_special": true}
2.04.974.710 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3833,314,780,26043,557,10548,11,2166,11,748,551,7448,914,4884,279,14882,1245,3023,13,220]}
