2.04.974.954 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
2.04.974.954 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Eventually he was able to rig a makeshift mast and sail, but he could make little headway against the currents. ", "add_special": true}
2.04.974.955 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[65687,551,557,2858,310,12864,264,83109,18137,321,28443,11,694,551,1362,1236,2545,1901,3017,2272,279,57587,13,220]}
