2.04.975.299 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
2.04.975.300 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"It moved so slowly.\" The boat capsized two more times before he was rescued, according to Jordan. ", "add_special": true}
