\\\" was accurate. A doctor's capacity declaration stated that Mitchell will likely be unable, due to her medical condition, to attend any court hearings for the next four to six months. Adoring fans are posting their tributes to Mitchell at WeLoveYouJoni.com. Sonya Hamasaki and Cheri Mossburg contributed to this report.\\n\", \"original_answer\": \"Joni Mitchell, 76, is a renowned singer-songwriter who has been inducted into the Rock and Roll Hall of Fame.\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 119, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:90120fe9c4708bd3dfa35ee7c0358d55154a955ed9e7d9e03815969f08ff5b27\"}, {\"end_byte\": 279, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 119, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:6bf573cf8887a6445b3ed65debe5f457d6f4151bf8a72672ed9e3fcefe5ac9fd\"}, {\"end_byte\": 367, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 279, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:90510a3430f36fc997f2488ae47794bb921d77469926b39bfa68b8032b4af634\"}, {\"end_byte\": 454, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 367, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:450b5ffc371d26d4e4061e0b3effab07f9ac2974189721fc01899542180d5720\"}, {\"end_byte\": 536, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 454, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:70c837b9ff8d9a24d84147314dbc4a9023c8bf05aa1525c948ef7f33cd267697\"}, {\"end_byte\": 868, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 536, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c530d5dee8ba2fa95b13870290a379b65c02e833bbb88ca2a329de5317e82dc4\"}, {\"end_byte\": 946, \"source_sentence_id\": 6, \"start_byte\": 868, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:1b6491da0bb9daf5da73812e92ffc67e9c3e4b312e9a01a9df4570c205b43239\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1042, \"source_sentence_id\": 7, \"start_byte\": 946, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:60afe0653139ba57353c1f14f538412fbf07df5d61b4557d87f4c4f01a3abebd\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1071, \"source_sentence_id\": 8, \"start_byte\": 1042, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:be52f9148ca493ca52cc4371196e7f36f6a97d69f1610f3fde1f8feae04bba96\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1478, \"source_sentenc