3.42.545.890 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
3.42.545.891 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Vivek Murthy and EPA Administrator Gina McCarthy for a roundtable discussion on the topic as part of National Public Health Week. ", "add_special": true}
3.42.545.891 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[53,520,74,14571,25577,321,25323,27659,73604,42485,364,264,4625,1938,9915,383,279,8282,430,919,314,4893,2968,6070,10040,13,220]}
3.42.546.123 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
3.42.546.128 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
3.42.546.129 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"I think we've always known -- or at least in the 20th century we've understood -- that environment has an impact on public health,\" the President told CNN's Dr. ", "add_special": true}
3.42.546.129 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6825,1683,567,2908,2590,3750,1137,466,506,3140,303,279,220,17,15,337,9018,567,2908,15513,1137,421,4424,682,449,5253,383,569,2730,1288,279,4642,3125,19166,579,2832,13,220]}
