3.42.547.985 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
3.42.547.985 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Asthma can be very difficult for patients, but also for their families. ", "add_special": true}
3.42.547.988 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[28180,29093,1667,628,381,1546,4839,364,6621,11,694,1048,364,836,8259,13,220]}
