3.42.548.225 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
3.42.548.226 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The impacts of climate change could make the situation worse.\" \"This is not just a future threat -- this is a present threat,\" said Brian Deese, a senior adviser to the President. ", "add_special": true}
3.42.548.226 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,24115,314,9682,2222,1362,1236,279,6331,10639,1149,328,1919,369,524,1066,264,3725,5716,1137,411,369,264,2945,5716,1288,1018,16580,1526,2290,11,264,9695,30711,310,279,4642,13,220]}
