3.42.548.469 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
3.42.548.471 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Deese cited a recent study by the American Thoracic Society that found seven out of 10 doctors reported climate change is contributing to more health problems among their patients. ", "add_special": true}
