4.29.918.683 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.918.684 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"And Glenn McGrath dismissed for two, just ninety-eight runs short of his century.\" \"From our broadcasting box you can't see any grass at all. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.918.685 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[44385,37812,84724,572,25364,364,1330,11,1066,75211,67354,8213,2716,314,780,9018,1149,328,3702,1004,47194,3618,488,628,914,1436,866,15879,506,660,13,220]}
