4.29.920.326 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.920.326 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "It was why he was so insightful as a commentator. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.920.327 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2064,557,3069,551,557,748,66724,430,264,66414,13,220]}
