4.29.920.465 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.920.465 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"As a player his record has withstood the test of time.  ", "add_special": true}
4.29.920.465 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45567,264,2693,780,3150,682,440,49942,279,1228,314,854,13,256]}
4.29.920.623 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.920.628 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.920.629 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He led the Australian side from 1958/59 through to 1963/1964, never losing a series in his 28 Tests as captain. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.920.629 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,5879,279,12982,3008,494,220,16,24,20,23,14,20,24,1472,310,220,16,24,21,18,14,16,24,21,19,11,2496,12806,264,3878,303,780,220,17,23,19537,430,23167,13,220]}
4.29.920.782 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.920.784 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.920.787 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"As captain, he was first to lead a full Australian tour to India and Pakistan in 1959/60. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.920.787 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45567,23167,11,551,557,1118,310,2895,264,2400,12982,6990,310,6535,321,16173,303,220,16,24,20,24,14,21,15,13,220]}
4.29.920.929 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.920.935 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.920.936 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He was the first cricketer to reach a Test double of 2,000 runs and 200 wickets. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.920.937 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,557,279,1118,1505,839,1356,310,5372,264,3284,1923,314,220,17,11,15,15,15,8213,321,220,17,15,15,288,16960,13,220]}
4.29.921.119 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.122 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.122 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Given the special place Richie Benaud has in our national life, I have asked that on the day of his funeral flags fly at half-mast. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.122 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1,21365,279,3175,1925,95549,417,6933,643,682,303,1004,5145,2199,11,353,599,4439,421,383,279,1834,314,780,29962,7789,11137,506,4139,1395,544,13,220]}
4.29.921.298 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.300 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.300 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "I extend my condolences and the condolences of the Australian people, to his wife Daphne and his family and friends. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.301 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[40,12663,821,76477,321,279,76477,314,279,12982,1208,11,310,780,7168,414,1294,785,321,780,2902,321,4627,13,220]}
4.29.921.483 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.485 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.486 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Current Australian captain Michael Clarke posted an image of Benaud on Instagram with the message: \"What a man. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.486 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[5237,12982,23167,7687,41141,8194,449,2099,314,417,6933,643,383,13589,440,279,1876,25,328,3710,264,855,13,220]}
4.29.921.609 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.611 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.611 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Extremely sad day. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.612 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6544,51469,12065,1834,13,220]}
4.29.921.737 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.739 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.739 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "You were a lot more then just a cricketer Richie. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.739 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2523,998,264,2609,777,1179,1066,264,1505,839,1356,95549,13,220]}
4.29.921.903 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.921.905 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.921.906 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "RIP.\" Clarke's former teammate Shane Warne also took to Instagram to post a touching letter to the late commentator. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.921.906 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[49,3191,1149,41141,579,4588,45981,48293,4843,785,1048,3738,310,13589,310,1675,264,29588,6321,310,279,3200,66414,13,220]}
4.29.922.073 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.075 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.075 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He wrote: \"Dear Richie, I've known you & Daphne for close to 30 years & to everyone you were a legend on all levels & rightly so too. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.078 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,5947,25,328,29664,95549,11,353,2908,3750,488,594,414,1294,785,364,3160,310,220,18,15,1578,594,310,4858,488,998,264,12643,383,660,5684,594,51575,748,2166,13,220]}
4.29.922.243 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.245 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.245 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"As a cricketer, commentator & as a person, you were the best there's ever been & to top it off, an absolute gentleman... ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.246 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[45567,264,1505,839,1356,11,66414,594,430,264,1637,11,488,998,279,1786,1017,579,3397,978,594,310,1844,424,974,11,449,10424,43623,1076,220]}
4.29.922.448 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.453 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.454 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "For me it was an honour & a privilege to call you a close friend & mentor, we had so many wonderful times together, talking cricket & in particular, our love & passion of leg spin bowling. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.454 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[2381,728,424,557,449,32450,594,264,24738,310,1562,488,264,3160,4099,594,34256,11,567,995,748,1599,10794,2942,3658,11,7169,34806,594,303,3820,11,1004,2854,594,11341,314,2392,12253,56241,13,220]}
4.29.922.597 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.598 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.598 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"I will cherish our entertaining dinners & all the fun times we shared over a long period of time. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.599 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[6825,668,83693,1004,28256,70819,594,660,279,2384,2942,567,5904,888,264,1248,4031,314,854,13,220]}
4.29.922.792 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.794 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.794 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "I would also like to thank you & Daphne for all your support & time you made for me as a young cricketer & leg spin bowler trying to make his way as an 18 year old, your tips & advice along the journey meant so much !!! ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.794 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[40,1000,1048,1040,310,9414,488,594,414,1294,785,364,660,678,1761,594,854,488,1801,364,728,430,264,3777,1505,839,1356,594,2392,12253,14829,1482,4313,310,1236,780,1560,430,449,220,16,23,1007,2235,11,678,10104,594,9183,3055,279,11285,8526,748,1691,31780,220]}
4.29.922.931 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.922.933 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.922.933 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"Richie, you were loved by everyone, not just the cricket family, you were the godfather of cricket & you will be missed by all... ", "add_special": true}
4.29.922.933 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1,26303,627,11,488,998,9939,539,4858,11,524,1066,279,34806,2902,11,488,998,279,9593,22300,314,34806,594,488,668,381,13235,539,660,1076,220]}
4.29.923.082 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.084 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.084 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "R.I.P my friend.\" Benaud, who was born in 1930 in Penrith, New South Wales, lead Australia into an era of world dominance as a player. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.084 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[49,2367,1034,821,4099,1149,417,6933,643,11,852,557,8950,303,220,16,24,18,15,303,12909,81,402,11,1478,4725,22218,11,2895,8071,1083,449,11057,314,1814,42054,430,264,2693,13,220]}
4.29.923.215 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.216 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.216 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "But it was after he hung up his spikes that his legendary status was confirmed. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.217 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[3850,424,557,1238,551,17750,685,780,48955,421,780,26814,2552,557,10457,13,220]}
4.29.923.393 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.395 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.395 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Writing in a column in The Australian, cricket writer Gideon Haigh wrote \"television was Benaud's calling, suiting his captain's spontaneity and intuition. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.395 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[38013,303,264,3145,303,561,12982,11,34806,6700,469,95711,13697,1055,5947,328,647,10547,557,417,6933,643,579,7842,11,885,5672,780,23167,579,35092,2077,477,321,54361,13,220]}
4.29.923.564 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.566 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.566 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"He was authoritative but not pedantic, dignified but not pompous, and never spoke unless he had something to say. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.571 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[25485,557,62411,694,524,10164,7902,11,26683,1806,694,524,70297,757,11,321,2496,11938,7014,551,995,2414,310,1910,13,220]}
4.29.923.765 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.767 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.767 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He was so popular that many humorists strove to imitate him, so distinctive that none ever quite got him right.\" The BBC's cricket correspondent Jonathan Agnew agreed. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.767 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,557,748,5243,421,1599,26498,1612,29421,571,310,712,19051,1384,11,748,33692,421,6643,3397,4847,2597,1384,1245,1149,561,17557,579,34806,46947,22545,4449,902,7003,13,220]}
4.29.923.879 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.923.880 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.923.881 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"He was quite simply peerless. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.923.881 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[25485,557,4847,4777,13984,1657,13,220]}
4.29.924.011 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.013 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.013 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Nobody else had his authority, popularity and skill,\" Agnew said in a column on the BBC website. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.013 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[54816,745,995,780,10872,11,21838,321,9653,1288,4449,902,1018,303,264,3145,383,279,17557,3779,13,220]}
4.29.924.285 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.291 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.292 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"If you speak to any broadcaster from any sport, they will point to Richie as the standard-bearer.\" Australian national team coach Darren Lehmann said Benaud set \"an incredibly high standard on and off the field.\" \"The fact that Australia never lost a series under his captaincy says so much and those standards were just as high when he turned his attention to calling the game,\" he told cricket.com.au. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.292 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[25855,488,6266,310,866,57861,494,866,10239,11,781,668,1406,310,95549,430,279,5129,1402,20152,1149,12982,5145,2015,7020,55084,60450,17039,1018,417,6933,643,716,328,276,16323,1496,5129,383,321,974,279,2002,1149,328,760,2029,421,8071,2496,5384,264,3878,1172,780,23167,10807,2640,748,1691,321,1782,10344,998,1066,430,1496,948,551,6316,780,6326,310,7842,279,1746,1288,551,3125,34806,877,29771,13,220]}
4.29.924.422 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.424 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.424 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "\"We loved listening to him commentate when the team was together in the dressing room. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.424 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[10397,9939,13879,310,1384,3847,344,948,279,2015,557,3658,303,279,30486,2956,13,220]}
4.29.924.609 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.611 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.611 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "When he was on air, we always had the TV volume turned up because his comments were so insightful.\" Benaud's passing also drew messages of sympathy on social media from beyond his native Australia. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.611 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[4350,551,557,383,3594,11,567,2590,995,279,5701,7867,6316,685,1521,780,5853,998,748,66724,1149,417,6933,643,579,11946,1048,22819,6397,314,44448,383,3471,3561,494,7551,780,9575,8071,13,220]}
4.29.924.848 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.850 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.850 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Imran Khan, the former captain of Pakistan and now a leading politician there, tweeted: \"Saddened by the death of Richie Benaud, one of the greatest cricketing brains.\" While Kumar Sangakkara, the current captain of Sri Lanka's Test team, posted: \"So sad to hear about the passing of Richie Benaud. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.854 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1378,6368,23525,11,279,4588,23167,314,16173,321,1381,264,6187,34747,1017,11,25125,25,328,50,698,6546,539,279,4397,314,95549,417,6933,643,11,799,314,279,11848,34806,286,32973,1149,5788,38808,49210,29057,4897,11,279,1428,23167,314,32242,41066,579,3284,2015,11,8194,25,328,4272,12065,310,6512,883,279,11946,314,95549,417,6933,643,13,220]}
4.29.924.954 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.924.956 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.924.956 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "The great voice of cricket is no more. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.924.956 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[760,2172,7497,314,34806,369,874,777,13,220]}
4.29.925.121 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.925.123 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.925.123 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "He defined an era with conviction and sincerity.\" British Prime Minister David Cameron tweeted: \"I grew up listening to Richie Benaud's wonderful cricket commentary. ", "add_special": true}
4.29.925.124 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[1465,4364,449,11057,440,27181,321,95695,1149,7607,12159,9206,6584,25581,25125,25,328,40,13538,685,13879,310,95549,417,6933,643,579,10794,34806,29611,13,220]}
4.29.925.292 D srv          stop: all tasks already finished, no need to cancel
4.29.925.296 I srv  log_server_r: done request: POST /tokenize 127.0.0.1 200
4.29.925.296 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Like all fans of the sport, I will miss him very much.\" CNN's Pierre Meilhan and Azadeh Ansari contributed to this report.\n", "add_special": true}
4.29.925.296 D srv  log_server_r: response: {"tokens":[12578,660,6985,314,279,10239,11,353,668,3016,1384,1546,1691,1149,19166,579,35752,2088,319,9623,321,14947,986,71,37176,2692,18991,310,411,1830,13,198]}
