der’s special service offered for SMS.\\\\n\\\\npassage 3:SMS only allows you to send text. MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.MMS message can carry a larger size of content up to 300KB in extensions of WAV, JPEG, Gif etc. You can find more information about it on the link below.MS only allows you to send text. MMS allows you to send pictures, sounds, videos, text, or any combination of the four.\\\\n\\\\n\\\",\\\"question\\\":\\\"what is the difference between sms and mms\\\"}\", \"original_answer\": \"Sure!\", \"source_sentence_offsets\": [{\"end_byte\": 112, \"source_sentence_id\": 0, \"start_byte\": 0, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:8807e2c178045f6ba6f6c04073429ffa16c8051ce1e51a601e2f49c4feb764ee\"}, {\"end_byte\": 190, \"source_sentence_id\": 1, \"start_byte\": 112, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:c46d23886d4606ee274a0ae3f5e6266800cb4a321a7c63bee3883fd5006e374c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 515, \"source_sentence_id\": 2, \"start_byte\": 190, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:dc1834b11bae31d1fc8fd1fb0f6870eeddac7c1e160839e735d575f45aa94c1c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 676, \"source_sentence_id\": 3, \"start_byte\": 515, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:9d5a2e3f73ff1de123c485cd87913a1f61718efbf7efbb42780d69e066260972\"}, {\"end_byte\": 743, \"source_sentence_id\": 4, \"start_byte\": 676, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:1d86192ea964cd2edbe0cbceee980bbac6d6a916322333e3284960ac17080dca\"}, {\"end_byte\": 797, \"source_sentence_id\": 5, \"start_byte\": 743, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:31f08d877ff15c1f287445b27c48a547e06444f31801e9eef5e8b020340af20b\"}, {\"end_byte\": 931, \"source_sentence_id\": 6, \"start_byte\": 797, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:9bdee1f07db17323bb4ab83eed3e50a76c80ea638c45044ba34545fd34b09a7c\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1059, \"source_sentence_id\": 7, \"start_byte\": 931, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:f37dfb9a8fba4b4b7331cbff992ce0c7fdd2e9d4512da4fad261169ef7499cb2\"}, {\"end_byte\": 1223, \"source_sentence_id\": 8, \"start_byte\": 1059, \"text_sha256\": \"sha256:89