4.46.014.379 D srv  log_server_r: request:  {"content": "Thousands of Yazidis now call this corner of Iraqi Kurdistan home, about 18 miles (30 kilometers) from one of the front lines with ISIS, where one can hear the occasional reverberation in the distance of what we are told are airstrikes. ", "add_special": true}
